@startuml
title C9 LinkML schema diff -> migration -> SPARQL Update -> SHACL gate
participant "LinkML v1 / v2" as LML
participant "Schema differ (missing)" as DIFF
participant "Migration compiler (missing)" as COMP
participant "Migration runner (missing)" as RUN
participant "SPARQL store" as ST
participant "pySHACL" as PS
LML -> DIFF : two SchemaViews + deprecated_element_has_exact_replacement hints
DIFF -> COMP : rename / add / remove / range change / cardinality change
COMP -> RUN : timestamped .sparql files (DELETE/INSERT/WHERE per change)
RUN -> ST : take lock, check checksum, apply, write log triples (admin graph)
RUN -> PS : validate migrated data with v2 shapes
alt conforms
  RUN -> ST : commit log entry
else violations
  RUN -> ST : run down migration or restore snapshot
end
note over DIFF, RUN : Nothing exists today: no LinkML diff command, linkml-map has no SPARQL compiler, mu-migrations-service has no lock/checksum/down
@enduml
